      - family-names: Han
        given-names: Jiaxin
      - family-names: Jing
        given-names: Yipeng
    journal: "Science China Physics, Mechanics, and Astronomy"
    volume: 68
    issue: 8
    start: 289512
    year: 2025
    doi: 10.1007/s11433-025-2671-0
    url: "https://arxiv.org/abs/2502.11160"
    notes: >-
      The CSST matter power spectrum emulator, cited as the closest comparable
      work rather than a dependency: emu_pk emulates the *linear* spectrum and
      does not use CEmulator.
